        "cooked": "<p>WTaP has been discussed before. &nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/setbacks-wrong-time-and-place-5224\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">This thread</a> failed to get any official resolution, but there seemed to be a general consensus that the wording is most similar to Miss Information's Character Card, which would limit the trigger to the first hero target to get damaged each turn.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Fortunately for Foote, his opinions on this thread and that one appear to be consistent.</p>",
