        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fortunately for Foote, his opinions on this thread and that one appear to be consistent.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Me? Consistent? I don't believe you.</p>\n<p>Edit: Just re-read that thread. I was not consistent! I knew it! The consensus was that they&nbsp;<em>were</em> the same, and that it would trigger for each hero target.&nbsp;</p>",
