        "created_at": "2015-01-06T01:51:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>just to clarify, if the amount is 0 to the lowest HP hero target then Smoke Bombs will not redirect.</p><p>If 1 damage would be dealt to the lowest Smoke Bombs will redirect, then lower it to 0. &nbsp;So it would be 0 damage to the highest, which could then increase above zero for things like nemesis bonus.</p>",
